    "title": "Bitwise And Vise Bring Crypto Model Portfolios To Financial Advisors - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bitcoinist ,\n21 hours ago Bitwise and Vise have launched diversified crypto model portfolios for financial advisers using the Vise platform. Vise says its network covers more than 135,000 accounts and over $140 billion in platform assets. Crypto allocations can now sit inside the same portfolio-management, rebalancing and tax framework as equities, bonds and alternatives. Read full article",
